  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the broiler. ",
    "Place the peppers on a baking sheet and broil for 10-15 minutes, or until slightly charred. ",
    "Remove the peppers from the oven and let cool. ",
    "Peel off the skin, seed, and chop the peppers. ",
    "In a blender or food processor, puree the peppers with gochujang, soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, garlic, and a pinch of salt and pepper. ",
    "Heat the vegetable oil in a mini cocotte over medium heat. ",
    "Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3-4 minutes. ",
    "Add the pepper puree and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes, stirring constantly. ",
    "If using egg, stir it into the pepper mixture and cook for 1-2 minutes, until lightly set. ",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed. ",
    "Garnish with green onions, toasted sesame seeds, and cilantro (if using). ",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy! "
  ],
